{
  "name": "cobra",
  "_about": "SCULPTED (2026-11-21, tools/creaturegen/rework/herps/snakes.py): the INDIAN COBRA, Naja naja, 1.5 m, REARED: the front of the body raised upright 40 cm (a `hood` bone stood on the body's front, the head level on top of it, swaying), THE HOOD spread wide either side of the neck, the rest of the body curled on the ground behind; a rounded head with big crown shields and round pupils; brown above, the SPECTACLES on the back of the hood (two pale eyes with dark middles joined by a pale curve), the throat pale with dark bands across under the hood and two dark spots, faint dark crossbands on the body. Coats: spectacled brown, black, wheat, monocled (N. kaouthia: one pale ring).",
